  "details": "Using the Color From Albedo option on outlines in ToonStandardOutline does not consider the main color, only the main texture.\n\nWith a texture and color set, the outline color comes only from the texture without the modification based on the main color.\n\nWith no texture set, the outline is simply white, no matter what the main color or outline color is set to.\n\nThe attached images show, with Color From Albedo set to 1:\n\n1. Rainbow main texture with main color set to white, outline is as expected\n\n2. Rainbow main texture with main color set to blue, outline still takes only from tex\n\n3. Main texture unset with main color set to blue, outline is white",
